WEBVTT

00:08:57.608 --> 00:09:00.059
Are you willing to take
the multiple layers?

00:09:00.083 --> 00:09:03.893
EP: No, I think that I always look
at who has power in this matter.

00:09:03.917 --> 00:09:07.643
AG: OK, good. So who do you think has
more power in our relationship here?

00:09:07.667 --> 00:09:09.768
EP: Right now?
AG: Yeah, or just in general.

00:09:09.792 --> 00:09:11.601
I don't know, I'm curious.

00:09:11.625 --> 00:09:14.893
EP: At this moment
between the two of us, it alternates.

00:09:14.917 --> 00:09:16.184
AG: How so?

00:09:16.208 --> 00:09:18.059
(Laughter)

00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:20.601
EP: You know, it's like
we had this conversation,

00:09:20.625 --> 00:09:24.059
you think ping pong,
I think billiards, right?

00:09:24.083 --> 00:09:27.351
So ping pong is this dyadic thing
where you try to surprise

00:09:27.375 --> 00:09:29.226
and to make -- you know.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.684
Billiard is about, you know,